          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will also stretch out mine hand upon Judah, and upon all the inhabitants of Jerusalem; and I will cut off the remnant of Baal from this place,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.1.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.1.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the name of the Chemarims with the priests;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And them that worship the host of heaven upon the housetops; and them that worship",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
