              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath prepared a sacrifice, he hath bid his guests.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass in the day of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD's",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.1.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.1.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sacrifice, that I will punish the princes, and the king's children, and all such as are clothed with strange apparel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the same day also will I punish all those that leap on the threshold, which fill their masters' houses with violence and deceit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass in that day, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that there shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the noise of a cry from the fish gate, and an howling from the second, and a great crashing from the hills.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Howl, ye inhabitants of Maktesh, for all the merchant people are cut down; all they that bear silver are cut off.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass at that time,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will search Jerusalem with candles, and punish the men that are settled on their lees: that say in their heart, The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will not do good, neither will he do evil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore their goods shall become a booty, and their houses a desolation: they shall also build houses, but not inhabit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.1.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.1.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and they shall plant vineyards, but not drink the wine thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
